1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.780
本吉奥: So initially it's exhilarating to have all this attention, and it's great to have all this recognition.
一开始，受到这么多关注令人兴奋；获得这些认可也很好。

2
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:19.160
本吉奥: And also, its great to attract really the best minds that are coming here for doing PhD's and things like that.
而且，能吸引真正出色的人才来这里读博士等，也是非常好的事情。

3
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:28.160
本吉奥: It's absolutely great. But sometimes I feel that it's been too much, that I don't deserve that much attention.
这当然很棒。但有时候，我觉得关注有些过多了，我不值得这么多关注。

4
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:44.890
本吉奥: And that all these interactions with media and so on are taking time away from my research and I have to find the right balance here.
而与媒体等各方的互动，占用了我的研究时间。我必须在这里找到合适的平衡。

5
00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:57.400
本吉奥: I think It is really important to continue to explain what we're doing so that more people can learn about it and take advantage of it, or become researchers themselves in this area.
我认为，持续向人们解释我们在做什么非常重要，这样更多人才能了解它，利用它，或者自己成为这个领域的研究者。

6
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:04.900
本吉奥: But I need to also focus on my main strength which is not speaking to journalists.
但我也需要专注于自己的主要长处，而我的长处并不是和记者交谈。

7
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:14.400
本吉奥: My main strength is to come up with new ideas, crazy schemes, and interacting with students to build new things.
我的主要长处是想出新点子、大胆的方案，并与学生交流，一起创造新东西。
